{"id":"5b13bea8fb4eeb65","group":"91","path":"91/91-df-truth-negation-axiom.md","title":"真理否定公理","display":"df-truth-negation-axiom — 真理否定公理","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth","book_abbrev":"91","label":"91-df-truth-negation-axiom","aliases":["91-df-truth-negation-axiom","91-df-neg-axiom"],"display":"df-truth-negation-axiom — 真理否定公理","depends_on":["[[91-df-internal-negation]]","[[91-df-external-negation]]","[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","[[91-df-numeral]]","[[91-df-substitution-function]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Axiomatic Theories of Truth"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"91"},{"key":"label","html":"91-df-truth-negation-axiom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>91-df-truth-negation-axiom</span><span>91-df-neg-axiom</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-truth-negation-axiom — 真理否定公理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"e369e02605242bf1\" href=\"?note=e369e02605242bf1\" title=\"91-df-internal-negation\">91-df-internal-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2c8fb2a4f3910429\" href=\"?note=2c8fb2a4f3910429\" title=\"91-df-external-negation\">91-df-external-negation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"822ef14bbd4e020d\" href=\"?note=822ef14bbd4e020d\" title=\"91-df-numeral\">91-df-numeral</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"95643c507a4d6dc3\" href=\"?note=95643c507a4d6dc3\" title=\"91-df-substitution-function\">91-df-substitution-function</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-truth-negation-axiom-—-真理否定公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}$\">df-truth-negation-axiom — 真理否定公理 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal L_T\">\\(\\mathcal L_T\\)</span> (含真理谓词的语言)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span> (真理谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0838e653809dc677\" href=\"?note=0838e653809dc677\" title=\"91-df-truth-predicate\">91-df-truth-predicate</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (句子)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\chi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> (至多以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 为自由变元的公式)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\overline n\">\\(\\overline n\\)</span> (自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的数字)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}_{v}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}_{v}\\)</span> (无捕获代入的编码函数)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}},\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}},\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\)</span> 是下述分别定义的两套否定真理公理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS}\">\\(\\mathrm{KF},\\mathrm{FS}\\)</span> 为系统角色上标。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DN}_{T}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NT}_{T}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ND}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\lor\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NC}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NAll}_{T}(\\chi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\forall v\\,\\chi(v)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{v}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\chi(v)\\urcorner},n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NEx}_{T}(\\chi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\exists v\\,\\chi(v)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{v}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\chi(v)\\urcorner},n)).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DN}_{T}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NT}_{T}(\\varphi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner}),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ND}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\land\\psi)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\lor\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NC}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg(\\varphi\\lor\\psi)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\left(\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\land\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\psi\\urcorner})\n\\right),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NAll}_{T}(\\chi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\forall v\\,\\chi(v)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{v}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\chi(v)\\urcorner},n)),\\\\\n\\operatorname{NEx}_{T}(\\chi)&amp;\\coloneqq\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\exists v\\,\\chi(v)\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall n\\,\nT(\\operatorname{Sub}_{v}\n(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\chi(v)\\urcorner},n)).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}negation\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{DN}_{T}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{NT}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{ND}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi),\n\\operatorname{NC}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi)\n\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{NAll}_{T}(\\chi),\n\\operatorname{NEx}_{T}(\\chi)\n\\mid\\chi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\},\n\\\\[1mm]\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}truth\\text{-}negation\\text{-}axiom}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\{\\operatorname{DN}_{T}(\\varphi),\n\\operatorname{NT}_{T}(\\varphi)\n\\mid\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{ND}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi),\n\\operatorname{NC}_{T}(\\varphi,\\psi)\n\\mid\\varphi,\\psi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\}\\\\\n&amp;{}\\cup\n\\{\\operatorname{NAll}_{T}(\\chi),\n\\operatorname{NEx}_{T}(\\chi)\n\\mid\\chi(v)\\in\\mathrm{Fml}^{1}_{\\mathcal L_T}\\},\n\\\\[1mm]\n\\operatorname{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\coloneqq{}&amp;\n\\left\\{\nT(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\ \\middle|\\\n\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathcal L_T}\n\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{KF}}\\)</span> : KF的否定公理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}^{\\mathrm{FS}}\\)</span> : FS的否定公理</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\">\\(T(\\ulcorner \\neg \\varphi \\urcorner) \\leftrightarrow \\neg T(\\ulcorner \\varphi \\urcorner)\\)</span> : 内外否定等价</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这里必须区分两个层次：\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 是内部否定句为真，\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 是外部否认“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 为真”。</p>\n<p>KF 并不在“正公式”上采用这两者的一般等价。它给出强 Kleene\n固定点所验证的负复合式公理：双重否定、De Morgan、量词对偶，以及</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\n\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\n\\urcorner})\n\\leftrightarrow T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span> 是真值间隙句，则外部式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(\\neg T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 可以为真，而内部式\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\">\\(T(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\neg\\varphi\\urcorner})\\)</span> 仍不成立；所以把 KF 写成受限的\n“内外否定等价”会抹去其核心语义。</p>\n<p>FS 则以经典否定双条件作为全句子模式，并配合 capture/release 规则。\n两套公理都在经典外部逻辑中陈述，但它们规定的真理谓词行为不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-truth-negation-axiom-—-真理否定公理-$\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}$","text":"df-truth-negation-axiom — 真理否定公理 $\\mathrm{Ax}_{\\neg}$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"91-df-internal-negation","status":"resolved","id":"e369e02605242bf1","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-internal-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-external-negation","status":"resolved","id":"2c8fb2a4f3910429","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-external-negation]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-truth-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"0838e653809dc677","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-truth-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"91-df-numeral","status":"resolved","id":"822ef14bbd4e020d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[91-df-nu